# Build-context hygiene for `docker build .` from the repo root
# (contrib/glama/Dockerfile does `COPY . .` into its build stage). The release
# image is built by goreleaser from its own context of prebuilt binaries
# (.goreleaser.yaml dockers_v2) and is not affected by this file.
#
# Never ship private key material, a real (non-example) config or local
# working state into any image layer — not even a discarded build stage.
**/pki/
**/config.json
**/signer.json
**/control-plane.json
**/broker-ctl.json
**/*.log
lab/work*/
dist*/
site/
.venv/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
